    {
      "type": "text", "id": "s2_tension", "x": 60, "y": 512, "width": 1300, "height": 40,
      "text": "⚠  Two URL spaces (/projects/… and /docs/…), five hand-maintained chromes, and an extra click on every operational page.\n    portal_shell.py is the good one — but build_portal.py never imports it, it keeps a hand-cloned twin at lines 698-780.",
